# Enterprise Creator Intelligence (Platform SSOT)

**Status:** **ACTIVE** — Sprint 1–6 protected baselines · **NOT FROZEN**  
**Acceptance:** `docs/architecture/ENTERPRISE_CREATOR_INTELLIGENCE_ACCEPTANCE.md` (CONDITIONAL — open gaps)  
**Spec:** `docs/architecture/ENTERPRISE_CREATOR_INTELLIGENCE.md`  
**Code:** `lib/enterprise-creator-intelligence/`  
**Registry:** `docs/architecture/PLATFORM_CAPABILITY_REGISTRY.md`

## Mandatory

1. Creator commercial · audience · category/brand · performance · investment intelligence for Planning / Client / Campaign / Reporting / Analytics / AI / Mobile **must** come from `@/lib/enterprise-creator-intelligence`.
2. Do **not** invent parallel creator investment scores, audience-quality investment signals, or commercial intelligence engines for those consumers.
3. Do **not** freeze or mark Maintenance Mode until Product Acceptance gates pass (see acceptance doc).
4. Do **not** begin Planning Workspace implementation until Acceptance freeze is approved.
5. Later layers **consume** earlier layers — never redesign Sprint 1–6 protected baselines.
6. Append-only history only — never overwrite prior intelligence captures.
7. AI-ready hints only in Phase 1 — **no AI execution**.
8. No Production deploy of ECI schema without explicit approval.

## Forbidden as Planning / investment SSOT

- `lib/creators/thinkway-score.ts` (Discovery browse score)
- Campaign decision simulators as enterprise investment recommendations
- Independent CPM/CPE/ROI/EMV engines that bypass ECI commercial formulas for creator intelligence surfaces

## Allowed

- Platform formula helpers reused **by** ECI (`lib/campaigns/performance-calculations.ts`)
- Discovery acquisition tools (remain Discovery — not enterprise investment)
- Sibling ECI extensions (Brand Safety, Fraud, Pricing Prediction) that **extend** the package without redesigning Sprint 1–6

